 \u201csoul is in the software\u201d but instead of taking of small parts of them, they were able to project themselves as a hologram as long as they could tap in to a light source?</div> </div> </div> </div>To keep things simple i would do it that way:<br /> Extempore, Humour=Light<br /> <br /> Use Extempore rules for Disquiet, torment and wasteland, or use a random shifting between Galateid and unfleshed ones.<br /> <br /> To regain Pyros while dreaming, spend time in a light rich (even artificial) environment.<br /> <br /> She is an &quot;advertising tool&quot;, so for the Bestowment i would use a variation of Symbiotic muse, that works on crowds instead of individuals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}